    "text": {
     "en": "With a compass and ruler we can construct an angle of 60 degrees by drawing arcs of the same radius.\nAn angle bisector divides an angle into two equal parts. The bisector of a 60 degree angle makes two 30 degree angles.\nConstructions need accurate settings and sharp pencils."
    }
